Value Filldown ETH_TRUNK (\S+)
Value Filldown OPERATE_STATUS (\S+)
Value Filldown NUMBER_OF_UP_PORT_IN_TRUNK (\d+)
Value Required INTERFACE (\S+\s+\S+)
Value Required STATUS (\S+)
Value PORT_TYPE (\S+)
Value PORT_PRIORITY (\d+)
Value PORT_NUMBER (\d+)
Value PORT_KEY (\d+)
Value PORT_STATE (\d+)
Value WEIGHT (\d+)

Start
  ^${ETH_TRUNK}'s\s+state\s+information\s+is:
  ^\(h\):\s+high\s+priority
  ^\(r\):\s+reference\s+port
  ^Local:
  ^LAG\s+ID:\s+\d+\s+WorkingMode:\s+\S+
  ^Preempt\s+Delay\s+Time:\s+\d+\s+Hash\s+arithmetic:
  ^System\s+Priority:\s+\d+\s+System\s+ID:
  ^Least\s+Active-linknumber:
  ^Operate\s+status:\s+${OPERATE_STATUS}\s+Number\s+Of\s+Up\s+Ports\s+In\s+Trunk:\s+${NUMBER_OF_UP_PORT_IN_TRUNK}
  ^Timeout\s+Period:
  ^PortKeyMode:
  ^-+
  ^ActorPortName\s+Status\s+PortType\s+PortPri\s+PortNo\s+PortKey\s+PortState\s+Weight
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${STATUS}\s+${PORT_TYPE}\s+${PORT_PRIORITY}\s+${PORT_NUMBER}\s+${PORT_KEY}\s+${PORT_STATE}\s+${WEIGHT}\s* -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error
